>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_SLOW_STEP_TAC`

``` hol4
classicalLib.CS_SLOW_STEP_TAC : clasetLib.claset -> NTactical.ntactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the claset-explicit form of `SLOW_STEP_TAC`.

`CS_SLOW_STEP_TAC cs` safely saturates the state. If no safe step applies, it
appends unsafe-rule alternatives after the instantiating alternatives on
the first goal. Safe and unsafe wrappers participate. Results are replayed
and may contain residual goals.

Unlike `SLOW_STEP_TAC`, this interface uses a prepared rule set, preserves
its alternative result sequence, and does not process theorem-list markers.

### Failure

Produces no result if no safe, instantiating or unsafe transition applies.
Replay failure is reported as an error.

### Example

``` hol4
val slow_step =
  classicalLib.CS_SLOW_STEP_TAC (clasetLib.the_claset ());
```

